Description: A reproducible software implementation for the BIO215 Capstone Project. 
    This package encapsulates the pre-trained Random Forest classifier derived from the 
    BRFSS 2015 dataset and provides standardized prediction functions. It is designed 
    to ensure the reproducibility of the model inference logic used in the accompanying 
    Shiny web application.
